WEBVTT

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.610
The three separated at a fork in the road.

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:08.150
And now their whereabouts are undisclosed. Do they wish to protect themselves, other people,

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.780
or heavenly dreams?

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.750
The creases of disorder are a cauldron of three.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.370
To an endless, eternal picture of Hell,

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:19.440
pushing through time a door is dispelled.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.810
Your grudge shall be released.

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:28.990
At last, there is only a little more time before exams.

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:32.410
Make sure you study harder and more thoroughly, and don’t give up before the very end.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:35.240
Consider every day important.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:37.170
The real battle starts now!

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:42.820
<i>The real Hell is inside a person.</i>

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.140
<i>It’s inside you too.</i>

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:52.130
Well then, make sure the scheduled people stay behind today.

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:55.990
Egami, Bitou, Shiina, Mikage, and Gamou, right?

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:57.020
What?

00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:58.450
Yes.

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:00.000
Stand!

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:04.010
Yuzuki, I didn’t know you were on schedule today too!

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:05.550
What are you talking about?

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:07.820
What do you mean? It’s the tripartite interview!

00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:08.410
Oh…

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:10.560
Are you OK?

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:12.930
Yuzuki, you’ve been acting strangely recently…

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:14.170
Have you been studying too hard?

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:16.980
Oh, she came.

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:19.330
Mother! Over here!

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:25.220
Wouldn’t it be nice if we could all go to the same high school?

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:26.760
Hey, look, look!

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:28.570
Yuika’s debuting in a drama!

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:28.980
What?

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:29.960
What is it?

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:34.030
I said that being an actress would suit Yuika!

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:36.310
I’ve thought about it for a while…

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:38.780
It seems like she really aiming for the top.

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:39.810
Exactly.

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:40.810
What?

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:44.060
When I go to high school, I’m joining the drama club.

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:46.380
I’ll be working part-time at a pastry shop.

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:48.530
Since I want to become a patissiere!

00:01:48.530 --> 00:01:49.850
You’ll get fat again…

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:52.120
It’s OK, since it’s for my studies!

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:55.840
Have you all already thought about your future?

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:58.600
I haven’t thought about it concretely…

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:00.850
Just that I might want to work in something related

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:01.970
to mass communications.

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:03.050
How about you, Yuzuki?

00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:05.540
Oh… I…

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:07.140
Hey, Mikage!

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:09.350
It’s your turn.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:12.770
I see, if they have work, then there’s nothing we can do.

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:13.900
I’m very sorry.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:15.660
Well, let’s start.

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:17.170
Let’s see…

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:18.390
That’s strange…

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:19.760
What’s wrong?

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:21.860
Your papers…

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:23.140
Why aren’t they here?

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:26.170
Sensei, have you lost them?

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:28.800
No, they should be here, but…

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:31.790
It’s my fault, I’ll search for them properly later.

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:34.600
So, have you picked your choice of school?

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:36.890
No, not yet…

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:40.140
In which direction do you wish to head to in the future?

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:40.880
Uh…

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:44.370
Don’t you have something like childhood dreams?

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:47.670
Dreams…

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:30.490
This program is made possible by Sony Music, Aniplex,

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:33.910
and the listed sponsors.

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:38.340
Are you going home now?

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:39.790
Dreams…

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:41.820
Huh?

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:45.360
It seems like she’s wavering.

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:49.540
She’s been forced into the fate of becoming Jigoku Shoujo.

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:52.550
She probably can’t imagine a cheerful future.

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:57.870
Both ‘future’ and ‘dreams’ are bound to be the most brutal words for her.

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:03.130
Regardless, there’ll be a time when she’ll eventually have to choose by herself.

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:05.420
Even though it’s pitiful…

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:09.630
Kikuri’s dream is to become a first-rate Jigoku Shoujo!

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:12.340
That’s not something for you to decide.

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:15.040
Shut up, Hone!

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.770
Wind me!

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:19.970
Yes, hime!

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:21.970
Really…

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:29.420
I told you I can do it on my own!

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:37.510
Mother…

00:05:37.510 --> 00:05:38.810
Mother!

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:40.490
Wait for me!

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:41.670
Stop that!

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:44.160
Mother!

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:45.920
Hey, Mother!

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:50.830
Mother!

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:55.720
Mother…

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:06.490
Why…?

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:11.090
Ishimoto-sensei carried you here.

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:12.430
It was anemia.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:13.680
You’re OK now.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:15.680
You can go home when you feel better.

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:21.650
Sensei, what should I do?

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:31.100
Jigoku Shoujo said that real Hell is inside a person.

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:35.060
Even though I don’t want anybody to go to Hell!

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:36.360
But still…

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:41.880
When a person who caused someone pain was sent to Hell, you will feel relieved.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:42.710
Am I wrong?

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:48.430
A part of your heart is being forced to become hellish.

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:50.430
That…

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:53.490
Can you say it’s absolutely untrue?

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:55.300
That’s horrible!

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:57.230
How can you say something like that?

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:15.040
Sensei, did you have thoughts like this, too?

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:27.430
Sympathize with her.

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:32.340
That girl’s beginning to realize who she is.

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:37.060
She wants you to rescue her when she discovers the truth.

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:41.980
Only you can rescue yourself.

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:05.380
I’m sorry, did some of the ashes spill on you?

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:07.260
Are your clothes OK?

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:08.760
Yes, they’re OK.

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:11.760
It looks warm.

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:14.280
Y-Yes…

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:20.850
How warm…

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:23.340
That uniform is so nostalgic!

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:25.740
Did you attend Saigawara 4th Middle School?

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:26.640
Yes.

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:28.040
So you’re my senior.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.800
Are you a third year?

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:30.850
Yes.

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:36.440
I have to pick my choice school, but I don’t know anything about my future, so…

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:37.400
How about you, senpai?

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:40.670
I’m Sumika, Misono Sumika.

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:44.870
I went to Saigawara High for high school, and now I’m a second year at the Eishin Women’s College.

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:46.270
Amazing!

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:47.390
You’re brilliant!

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.270
I can give you some advice, if you’d like.

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:51.010
What?

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.390
Have you decided on a career path?

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:56.680
Yes, please…

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:59.100
Bring your school guide next time.

00:08:59.100 --> 00:08:59.760
Yes.

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:08.280
Oh, this person…

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:10.140
She’s my younger sister.

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:11.240
My twin.

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:13.070
Don’t we look totally different?

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:26.540
Oh, wonderful!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:28.400
Try to smile a bit more.

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:29.740
Oh, wonderful!

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:31.350
Well then, OK!

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:32.650
Yuika-chan, you were great!

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:33.480
Good job!

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:36.270
Good job to you, too!

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:40.080
Yuika-san, you’ve been picked to play the heroine in a drama, so

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.720
can you tell us how excited you are?

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:45.230
I don’t know anything, so anyhow, I’ll do my best!

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:46.430
Oh!

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:52.690
Oh, I’m so tired.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:55.380
I might get wrinkles from smiling too much.

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:59.160
Hey, hey, charismatic models shouldn’t behave like that!

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:00.070
Yeah, sure.

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:04.610
Hey, Masato, wanna go somewhere now?

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:05.420
Like the ocean!

00:10:05.420 --> 00:10:08.620
We can’t. Don’t you have to wake up early tomorrow?

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.060
Go home and rest.

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:13.020
What are you saying? You’re like my manager.

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:15.630
I’m just cheering you on.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:17.050
From my heart.

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:19.790
I see…

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:21.280
Then I’ll forgive you.

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:42.270
I beg of you…

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:43.350
Enough…

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:50.560
Oh, hello!

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:53.780
I thought I’d take you up on your offer.

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:55.300
What?

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:58.400
Um… high school exams…

00:10:58.400 --> 00:10:59.060
Oh!

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:01.890
Hey, Sumika!

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:03.120
I-I’m sorry!

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:04.630
I made a mistake…

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:06.290
Don’t treat me the same as someone like her!

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:08.790
Oh… yes…

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:11.770
Oh, Yuzuki-chan, come in!

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:13.230
Hello!

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:16.900
Oh, he’s here!

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:17.930
Really…

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:21.740
Hey, Masato, you’re late!

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:23.640
I’m sorry.

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:25.010
Good morning, Sumika-chan!

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:27.210
G-Good morning, Masato-san!

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:29.250
Have you read that book from before?

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:31.660
It was very interesting!

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:34.370
Just as I thought, the beginning of Japanese Fantasy Novels was…

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:36.640
Another set of worthless chatting again.

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:38.820
Hey, I can’t be late today!

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:41.340
Yeah. Later, Sumika-chan!

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:45.850
Hey, make sure you get the English Literature report done!

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:48.010
I know.

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:01.570
I’m sorry!

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:02.130
Not at all.

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:05.210
You both really look alike, don’t you?

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:07.660
Our parents frequently get us mixed up.

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:08.910
Look at this.

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:12.840
This is what’s different. I’m the only one who has it.

00:12:13.590 --> 00:12:16.770
Our faces are similar, but we’re totally different.

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:21.560
But both of you attend the Eishin Women’s College, right?

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:25.620
That isn’t Yuika’s true ability.

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:27.690
It’s because she got a substitute exam taker.

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:28.230
What?

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:31.750
I was already accepted by recommendation.

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:35.060
On exam day I impersonated her and took the test.

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:38.910
That story doesn’t matter at all.

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:40.840
Let’s think about high school.

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:42.490
What’s your dream, Yuzuki-chan?

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:44.090
Dream…

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:47.460
I was asked by my teacher and my friends, too, but…

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:49.640
I really don’t know, so…

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:51.940
After all, you’re only a middle schooler.

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:54.670
Then, what did you like when you were younger?

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:59.240
Once you become an adult, what you liked as a child becomes your full-time job, right?

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:02.150
When I was younger…

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:04.770
<i>Help me!</i>

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:05.990
Yuzuki-chan?

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:07.380
Yuzuki-chan?

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:08.800
Oh, I’m sorry.

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:12.930
I don’t know.

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:16.840
What kind of child I was, or what I want to do from now on…

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:18.820
No matter how much I think about it…

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:35.070
Hey, wasn’t I the best today?

00:13:35.070 --> 00:13:36.260
I’ll become a sta-!

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:38.730
Hey, be careful since you’re this drunk.

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:41.800
No, I told you it’s OK!

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:44.270
Hey, let’s go to that store!

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:45.510
I-I said, be careful!

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:51.140
Yuika?

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:52.710
Sumika-chan.

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:54.150
Is she OK?

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:58.370
You’re thinking it serves me right, aren’t you?

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:00.370
Of course not…

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:03.170
It seems a bone was fractured.

00:14:03.170 --> 00:14:04.930
It will heal smoothly.

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:06.810
I’m glad it just resulted in this.

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:07.420
I see…

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:09.310
What are you being happy about?

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:12.060
I have an important photo shoot tomorrow!

00:14:12.060 --> 00:14:13.530
Don’t push yourself too much.

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:14.620
You should rest tomorro-

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:17.750
No! It was a chance I was finally able to seize!

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.160
But with that body…

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:21.840
For what reason were you born with the same face?

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:34.190
It’s done.

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:38.640
This is… me?

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:40.140
Got it?

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:42.470
From today onwards, you are the model, Yuika.

00:14:42.470 --> 00:14:44.470
Not the lame Sumika.

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:46.690
Put on a big show!

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:49.310
If you mess up, I won’t forgive you.

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:02.550
OK, good.

00:15:02.550 --> 00:15:04.250
Turn around right there.

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:07.770
Let’s rest a bit.

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:09.330
What’s wrong, Yuika-chan?

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:11.330
You’re not like the usual.

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:13.270
I-I’m very sorry.

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:15.630
I’m very sorry.

00:15:15.630 --> 00:15:18.930
Not at all. I like today’s Yuika-san.

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:20.750
You have a nice attitude.

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:23.150
Maybe because your boyfriend’s here?

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:23.770
What?

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:30.120
Thank you for today.

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:33.160
Thanks to you, Masato, I was somehow able to get through today.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:37.510
No, Yuika originally asked you to do something unreasonable.

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:38.530
This much…

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:41.250
But, I’m not Yuika.

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:43.840
Something like this will eventually be found out.

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:45.330
You can do it.

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:49.550
Even if you look alike, you still have your set own talents.

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:51.770
I hope so.

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:54.170
Yeah. You’ll be all right.

00:15:54.170 --> 00:15:54.740
Don’t worry!

00:15:55.190 --> 00:15:56.050
Yeah.

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:09.450
Why don’t you understand?

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:11.050
My feelings?

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:13.230
It’s impossible now.

00:16:13.230 --> 00:16:13.770
With you…

00:16:14.730 --> 00:16:16.740
You’re going to dump me?

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:17.770
Fine.

00:16:17.770 --> 00:16:19.790
I also have an idea.

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:21.770
Hmph.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:24.900
Cut! OK!

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:27.810
Good work! Let’s go on to the next scene!

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:28.920
Set change!

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:33.050
Yuika-san, your image is completely different to your image until now.

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:34.650
It was quite a realistic performance!

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:38.330
Fully become the role, that’s all.

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:41.500
I believe there are two sides in everybody.

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:45.210
I would like to skillfully act those out separately.

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:49.040
So said the current on-the-rise rookie, Yuika!

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:50.740
From model to actress.

00:16:50.740 --> 00:16:53.710
That rare talent that blossoms on its own…

00:16:53.710 --> 00:16:55.790
Where did it come from?

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:56.560
Yeah! Yuika’s awesome, just as I thought.

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:57.360
That origin…

00:16:56.560 --> 00:17:00.780
And she’s not just cute! As expected from the girl that I counted on.

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:02.190
You say that all the time.

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:03.980
Even though you’re only her fan.

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:05.980
She is, as you say, wonderful…

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:06.950
Right?

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:09.410
Hey, Yuzuki, don’t you think so?

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:13.570
What? Yeah… you’re right…

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:24.160
Something’s fishy.

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:28.120
Those twin sisters are two sides of the same coin.

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:31.860
Although they’re both each other’s light and shadow.

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:34.040
Light and shadow, eh?

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:38.160
You’re going to dump me?

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:39.310
Fine.

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:41.520
I also have an idea.

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:44.690
Really, lines like these…!

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:55.340
Oh, hello, Yuika-san!

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:56.840
Hello.

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:59.210
How is your injury?

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:00.610
It’s mostly healed.

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:01.760
See you later.

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:15.070
Are you cold?

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:15.900
Is coffee fine?

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:17.630
I don’t need it.

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:20.060
What’s wrong, Yuika?

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:23.670
I’m lonely.

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:37.520
Yuika, does it still hurt?

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:40.620
Yuika…

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:41.610
What?

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:43.850
I’m OK.

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:45.350
Are you…?

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:46.270
What?

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:49.800
…really Yuika?

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:54.790
Sumika.

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:58.340
Could you not tell?

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:00.990
Why did something like this…

00:19:05.400 --> 00:19:08.060
Can’t you tell, Masato?

00:19:32.550 --> 00:19:33.860
Where do you think you’re going?

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:35.780
The photo shoot, of course.

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:37.060
My injury’s healed!

00:19:37.060 --> 00:19:38.850
You are no longer necessary!

00:19:38.850 --> 00:19:40.100
You can’t do it!

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:41.160
I can!

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:42.950
It’s a spot I won in the first place!

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:46.180
These are all mine!

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:47.360
What are you doing?

00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:47.970
Stop!

00:19:47.970 --> 00:19:48.960
Stop that!

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.200
Oh!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:54.910
I won’t hand it over to you!

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:56.700
You’re just my shadow!

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:16.190
Did you ask for me?

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.010
No!

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:43.180
Yuika-san? Sumika-san?

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:45.050
Which one is which?

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.180
It’s impossible now.

00:20:59.180 --> 00:21:01.580
I can’t keep doing it with you.

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:02.730
Let’s split up.

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:06.030
Are you going to choose her?

00:21:07.210 --> 00:21:08.270
Sorry.

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:09.190
Forgive me.

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:24.420
Your grudge has been received.

00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:27.230
Why?

00:21:27.230 --> 00:21:29.500
No! Let me out of here!

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:34.170
O pitiful shadow, wandering in darkness.

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:37.430
Scarring people and looking down on them.

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:40.170
The ball of karma is drowning in sin.

00:21:40.640 --> 00:21:42.110
What? No…

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:48.160
Want to try dying this once?

00:21:48.270 --> 00:21:51.760
No!

00:21:56.300 --> 00:21:59.340
Am I not supposed to chase after my dreams?

00:21:59.340 --> 00:22:02.060
Even though I just wanted to be myself…

00:22:02.980 --> 00:22:06.050
You and she are a combined mirror.

00:22:07.040 --> 00:22:13.270
Both Light and Dark arrive at that far away equilibrium, Eternal Hell.

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:19.190
This hatred will ferry you to Hell.

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:27.930
Will you please?

00:22:28.370 --> 00:22:31.510
Yuika-san, congratulations on your grand cup!

00:22:31.510 --> 00:22:33.400
How was your first starring role?

00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:41.710
Yes. I was able to discover a new me by participating in this wonderful work.

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:49.800
Note: Candle says Misono-ka.

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:49.800
Your grudge shall be released.

00:24:20.620 --> 00:24:22.190
Your name?

00:24:22.470 --> 00:24:24.520
Mizuhara Fumio.

00:24:24.520 --> 00:24:26.810
You’re being bullied?

00:24:26.810 --> 00:24:28.100
Yes.

00:24:28.550 --> 00:24:32.060
Even though I haven’t done anything to warrant being bullied.

00:24:32.900 --> 00:24:34.950
Even though I’m following their orders.

00:24:34.950 --> 00:24:37.660
Even though I’m giving them everything they want.

00:24:38.430 --> 00:24:42.040
I can’t understand their feelings at all!

00:24:43.820 --> 00:24:45.040
I see…

00:24:45.940 --> 00:24:48.720
Next time: Sunset Hill.

00:24:50.710 --> 00:24:55.880
This program is made possible by Sony Music, Aniplex,

00:24:55.880 --> 00:24:58.990
and the listed sponsors.
